Hello, as quick solution you could try specify limits in scale fill option

p1 + scale_fill_continuous <https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/scale_colour_continuous.html>(limits = c <https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/base/topics/c>(0,20), breaks = c <https://www.rdocumentation.org/packages/base/topics/c>(0, 5, 10, 15, 20)

where p1 is gg object

